@page "/markets/rfid"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "RFID Manufacturer: Cards, Tags, Inlays & Tire Tags";
    ViewData["Motion"] = "market";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Hana has manufactured RFID for over 20 years: smart cards, access credentials, tags, inlays and tire tags across LF, HF and UHF, in Thailand, China and the USA.";
    ViewData["Canonical"] = "https://www.hanagroup.com/markets/rfid";
}
@section Head {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/market-page.css" />
    <style>
      /* Testimonials under the design services block (17 Nov 2026); white logos, so they sit on the dark band */
      .mk-quotes{margin-top:56px;padding-top:40px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
      .mk-quotes-h{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7EC8FF;margin-bottom:22px}
      .mk-quotes-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}
      .mk-quote{margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:26px 24px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:6px;background:rgba(4,22,48,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
      .mk-quote-logo{display:block;width:auto;height:40px;max-width:150px;object-fit:contain;object-position:left center;margin-bottom:20px}
      .mk-quote blockquote{margin:0 0 20px;font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);flex:1}
      .mk-quote figcaption{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
      .mk-quote .nm{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}
      .mk-quote .rl{font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
      @@media(max-width:900px){.mk-quotes-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    </style>
}

<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">RFID</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><span class="hero-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 class="mk-h1">RFID manufacturing: cards, tags and inlays</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures smart cards, tags, inlays and tire tags across LF, HF and UHF, supported by more than 20 years of RFID design and manufacturing experience. Automated roll-to-roll inlay lines in China and the USA support high-volume production across multiple RFID form factors.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;" data-comment-anchor="769f58a33f-a">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="/images/photos/mk-rfid-hero.webp" alt="RFID inlays and smart labels" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>UHF inlays</span><span>HF inlays</span><a href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tags-inlays#asset-tracking">Asset-tracking tags</a><span>Temperature-sensing tags</span><a href="/markets/rfid/rfid-cards">Smart cards</a><a href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tire-tags">RFID tire tags</a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark" data-hana-geo="side" data-geo-theme="blue"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" data-comment-anchor="ae7e579c17-h2">Extensive RFID manufacturing and design services</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Encoding, converting and test are integrated into the RFID production flow, and every inlay and tag is encoded and read-verified before shipment with per-unit traceability. Hana is independent of any single RFID IC supplier and works across LF, HF and UHF.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Full breadth</div><p>Cards, tags, inlays and specialized RFID formats across LF, HF and UHF, including asset-tracking, logistics, temperature-sensing and battery-assisted passive applications.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Automated at volume</div><p>Automated roll-to-roll inlay production with in-line test and encoding, with selected UHF tag products ARC-certified through Hana&rsquo;s Ohio site.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>RFID manufacturing in Thailand, China and the USA provides additional production capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div>
@* Testimonials quoted as written from hanarfid.com/embeddable/rfid-tire-tagging/ (Hana Technologies),
   logos from the same page. Customer names approved for this block by Rupert, 17 Nov 2026. *@
<div class="mk-quotes"><div class="mk-quotes-h">What customers and partners say</div><div class="mk-quotes-grid">
<figure class="mk-quote"><img class="mk-quote-logo" src="/images/testimonials/goodyear.png" alt="Goodyear" width="200" height="70" loading="lazy" /><blockquote>&ldquo;RFID technology offers a dependable and unique identification and inventory tracking solution for Goodyear Racing&rsquo;s tire distribution within NASCAR. The RFID chips can store extensive data, endure the entire lifespan of the tire, and enable automated readings. Goodyear Racing selected this RFID solution as it represents the fastest and most reliable method available to meet our operational needs.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><span class="nm">Shannon Baker</span><span class="rl">Project Manager, Advanced Engineering &ndash; Race Tires, Goodyear</span></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="mk-quote"><img class="mk-quote-logo" src="/images/testimonials/michelin.png" alt="Michelin" width="200" height="70" loading="lazy" /><blockquote>&ldquo;This new license agreement between our companies will bring an innovative Generation 4 (Linkless) tag to the market, with better technical and sustainable performances. As a trusted partner, Hana will help us to deploy RFID technology worldwide to address future ecological challenges while answering to new norms and regulations as the Digital Product Passport.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><span class="nm">Laurent Couturies</span><span class="rl">RFID System Designer, Michelin</span></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="mk-quote"><img class="mk-quote-logo" src="/images/testimonials/impinj.png" alt="Impinj" width="200" height="70" loading="lazy" /><blockquote>&ldquo;Congratulations to the team at Hana RFID for reaching the top tier (Gold Partner) of the Impinj Partner Network. We&rsquo;re thrilled to support their work delivering innovative inlay solutions that support operational excellence for an expanding market of global organizations. We have valued our work with them and look forward to continuing our long and fruitful partnership.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><span class="nm">Sandy Murti</span><span class="rl">Vice President of Partner Development, Impinj</span></figcaption></figure>
</div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c4"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-cards"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-access-control-card-rfid-cards.webp" alt="Contactless smart cards and inlays" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Card Manufacturing</div><p>Contactless smart cards and credentials manufactured from inlay through lamination, printing, encoding and personalization, with automated production supporting high-volume programs.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tags-inlays"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-rfid-tags-inlays-apparel-tag.webp" alt="RFID apparel tag on retail footwear" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Tags &amp; Inlays</div><p>UHF and HF inlays and straps, ruggedized and rubber-embeddable tags, on-metal formats, temperature-sensing tags and battery-assisted passive products.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tire-tags"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-rfid-card-tire-tags.webp" alt="Tire-tag inlay and strap components" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Tire Tags</div><p>Rubber-embeddable UHF tire tags for integration into the tire structure, with read performance verified after cure.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/access-control/rfid-cards"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-access-control-hero.webp" alt="RFID access credential and reader" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Access Cards</div><p>Access cards, key fobs and credentials for access control systems, with secure chip handling and read/write verification.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:1080px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2><p class="mk-body" data-comment-anchor="e4b8513b35-p" style="max-width:1080px;">RFID manufacturing runs in Thailand, China and the USA. How these products are built is described on <a href="/capabilities/rfid-smart-tags">RFID &amp; Smart Tags</a>; see <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from RFID engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for RFID?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures contactless smart cards, UHF and HF inlays and straps, ruggedized and temperature-sensing tags, battery-assisted passive products and rubber-embeddable tire tags across LF, HF and UHF.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How long has Hana manufactured RFID?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana has designed and manufactured RFID products for more than 20 years, across LF, HF and UHF.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites make RFID?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">RFID inlays and straps are made in China, with six automated inlay lines at Jiaxing, and in the USA at Ohio. Tire tags are built in Thailand at Lamphun and in Ohio.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana make RFID tire tags?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana manufactures rubber-embeddable UHF tire tags for integration into the tire structure. Construction, testing and site details are on the <a href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tire-tags">RFID tire tags</a> page.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an RFID build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us the form factor, the band and the volume. We will point you to the right site and lines, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="https://hanarfid.com/contact/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hana-btn hana-btn-ghost-on-dark" style="padding:11px 21px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55);">Contact Hana RFID <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>

